<title>PORTUGAL: SocGen Australia issues five bln esc, 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>SocGen Australia issues five bln esc, 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Banco Essi.</p>
<p>BORROWER Societe Generale Australia Ltd</p>
<p>    AMT Five billion escudos   MATURITY 10 years</p>
<p>    ISS PRICE Par		  PAY DATE 26/2/97</p>
<p>    PAY FREQ  Six-monthly	GOV LAW English</p>
<p>    INTEREST  Six-month Lisbor plus 10 basis points</p>
<p>    LISTING Lux	  CLEARING Cedel and Euroclear</p>
<p>    S&amp;P Aa-		MOODY'S Aa2</p>
<p>NOTE - The issue carries a minimum interest of five percent and a maximum of 7.75 percent between the first and fourth years, eight percent from the fifth to the eighth and 8.25 percent in the ninth and tenth years. ((  --Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035 ))</p>
</text>
